XS) BETWEEN JANUARY 22, 2020 AND OCTOBER 6, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). THE LAWSUIT WAS FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF FLORIDA AND ALLEGES VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934.'}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:42:00', 'title': 'THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R. CRUZ ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (CTXS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CTXS #INVESTORS--THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R. CRUZ ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (CTXS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS'}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-11-22 16:40:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JANUARY 18, 2022 - CTXS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 22, 2021) - THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IS BEING ISSUED BY LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP:TO: ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SECURITIES OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. ("CITRIX") (NASDAQ: CTXS) BETWEEN JANUARY 22, 2020 AND OCTOBER 6, 2021. YOU ARE HEREBY NOTIFIED THAT A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF FLORIDA. TO GET MORE INFORMATION...'}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-11-22 16:16:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (CTXS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (“CITRIX” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: CTXS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON APRIL 29, 2021, BEFORE THE MARKET OPENED, CITRIX ANNOUNCED THAT CUSTOMERS DID NOT TRANSITION FROM SHORTER-DURATION, ON-PREMISE LICENSES TO LONG-TERM CLOUD ACCOUNTS AS EXPECTED. INSTEAD, MANY CUSTOMERS MOVED ON TO ANOTHER SHORT-TERM ON-PREMISE LIC"}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-11-22 13:06:00', 'title': 'CITRIX INVESTOR ALERT: SHAREHOLDER LAWSUIT FILED', 'text': "BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS--(NEWSFILE CORP. - NOVEMBER 22, 2021) - THE THORNTON LAW FIRM ALERTS INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (NASDAQ: CTXS). THE CASE IS CURRENTLY IN THE LEAD PLAINTIFF STAGE. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED CITRIX COMMON STOCK BETWEEN JANUARY 22, 2020 AND OCTOBER 6, 2021 MAY CONTACT THE THORNTON LAW FIRM'S INVESTOR PROTECTION TEAM BY VISITING WWW.TENLAW.COM/CASES/CITRIX FOR MORE INFORMATION. INVESTORS MAY ALSO EMAIL INVESTORS@TENLAW.COM..."}